   "problem": "研究監査の修正 5 回のうち 5 回で、修正担当に渡した指摘が主張・証拠の ID を参照しているのに、その定義（主張の本文、証拠の所在）を渡していなかった（参照 26 件）。",
   "hypothesis": "指摘が参照する主張・証拠の定義を、予算の範囲で文脈に添えれば、修正担当が参照先を特定できないまま対応することが減る。",
   "applies_when": "指摘が主張や証拠を ID で参照していて、その回の監査の主張・証拠の一覧が手元にあるとき",
   "side_effects": "文脈が長くなる。監査担当が書いた文章（信頼しない入力）が増える。",
   "allowed_paths": [
    "src/aar/engine/fix_context.py"
   ],
   "patch": "diff --git a/src/aar/engine/fix_context.py b/src/aar/engine/fix_context.py\nindex ad7ffae..01513e3 100644\n--- a/src/aar/engine/fix_context.py\n+++ b/src/aar/engine/fix_context.py\n@@ -25,4 +25,72 @@ def build_fix_context(findings: list[dict[str, Any]], *, claims: list[dict[str,\n     budget_chars: 返す文字列の長さの上限（現行方式は使っていない）。\n     \"\"\"\n     rows = [{\"issue_id\": f[\"issue_id\"], \"severity\": f[\"severity\"], \"title\": f[\"title\"], **(f.get(\"detail\") or {})} for f in findings]\n-    return json.dumps(rows, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2, default=str)\n+    base = json.dumps(rows, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2, default=str)\n+    limit = max(budget_chars if isinstance(budget_chars, int) else 0, len(base))\n+\n+    # 参照先の定義の表（ID -> 渡す項目）。文字列以外・空の ID は無視し、重複は最初のものを使う。\n+    defs: dict[str, dict[str, Any]] = {}\n+    for items, id_key, fields in (\n+        (claims, \"claim_id\", (\"claim_text\", \"status\")),\n+        (evidence, \"evidence_id\", (\"locator\", \"observed_result\")),\n+    ):\n+        for it in items or []:\n+            if not isinstance(it, dict):\n+                continue\n+            i = it.get(id_key)\n+            if not isinstance(i, str) or not i.strip() or i in defs:\n+                continue\n+            d = {id_key: i}\n+            for k in fields:\n+                v = it.get(k)\n+                if isinstance(v, str) and v.strip():\n+                    d[k] = v\n+            if len(d) > 1:\n+                defs[i] = d\n+    if not defs:\n+        return base\n+\n+    def mentioned(row: dict[str, Any]) -> list[str]:\n+        # 指摘の各値（文字列）に現れる ID を、現れた順に集める。ID の前後が英数字のものは別物として除く。\n+        found: list[tuple[int, str]] = []\n+        for key, val in row.items():\n+            if key in (\"issue_id\", \"severity\"):\n+                continue\n+            if not isinstance(val, str):\n+                continue\n+            for i in defs:\n+                p = val.find(i)\n+                while p >= 0:\n+                    a = val[p - 1] if p > 0 else \"\"\n+                    b = val[p + len(i)] if p + len(i) < len(val) else \"\"\n+                    if not (a.isascii() and a.isalnum()) and not (b.isascii() and b.isalnum()):\n+                        found.append((p, i))\n+                        break\n+                    p = val.find(i, p + 1)\n+        found.sort()\n+        out: list[str] = []\n+        for _, i in found:\n+            if i not in out:\n+                out.append(i)\n+        return out\n+\n+    # 同じ定義は最初に参照した指摘にだけ添える。予算に収まる範囲で、指摘の順に貪欲に足す。\n+    attached: list[list[dict[str, Any]]] = [[] for _ in rows]\n+    seen: set[str] = set()\n+\n+    def render() -> str:\n+        out_rows = []\n+        for r, a in zip(rows, attached):\n+            out_rows.append({**r, \"referenced_definitions\": a} if a else r)\n+        return json.dumps(out_rows, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2, default=str)\n+\n+    for n, r in enumerate(rows):\n+        for i in mentioned(r):\n+            if i in seen:\n+                continue\n+            attached[n].append(defs[i])\n+            if len(render()) > limit:\n+                attached[n].pop()\n+            else:\n+                seen.add(i)\n+    return render()",
   "patch_sha256": "dc9f6fcc77db205c8a3e128b8c6e917532b513d8dd99791e43b704f18a123525",
